				<wikidot:authorName>Grimm_92</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1382874</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My fiance and I met in our high school drama class and we are constantly going to local theatre events. The Foundation site has made me afraid of the dark and now I'm going to be sufficently creeped out the next time I go to a play lol<br /> Very well done.<br /> I can only think of one recommendation. You should think about making one or two of the acts of violence [REDACTED] to add the creepy unknown vibe of letting the reader come up with their own disturbing macabre events.<br /> Besides that, absolutely beautiful.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
